00:30:25.160 --> 00:30:26.740
there might be a way to track them down.

00:30:26.740 --> 00:30:28.119
I hate to break it to you,

00:30:28.119 --> 00:30:29.960
but this is a little bit bigger city than Smallville.

00:30:29.960 --> 00:30:32.079
He got his car from a booster at Metropolis Motors.

00:30:32.079 --> 00:30:33.619
It's got a TripStar system in it.

00:30:33.619 --> 00:30:35.539
If we can get the PIN number, we can use your cell phone

00:30:35.539 --> 00:30:38.000
and computer to maybe hack in and find out where they are.

00:30:38.000 --> 00:30:39.119
Okay, that's doable,

00:30:39.119 --> 00:30:40.539
but then how are we gonna get the PIN?

00:30:40.539 --> 00:30:42.259
I mean, they keep those things under lock and key

00:30:42.259 --> 00:30:44.000
at the dealership.

00:30:44.000 --> 00:30:47.960
What are you gonna do, break in and rip open the safe?

00:30:47.960 --> 00:30:49.339
Of course not.

00:31:08.000 --> 00:31:34.160
Don't worry.

00:31:34.160 --> 00:31:37.119
It'll be quick.

00:31:37.119 --> 00:31:37.980
Okay.

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:41.960
I'm so sorry.

00:31:41.960 --> 00:31:43.799
I never meant to hurt anyone...

00:31:43.799 --> 00:31:47.759
But I don't have a choice.

00:32:08.000 --> 00:32:09.299
I've got to be frustrated too.

00:32:09.299 --> 00:32:10.339
She got us some of those cars up.

00:32:10.339 --> 00:32:11.799
Yeah, put her, weirdo.

00:32:11.799 --> 00:32:14.180
But you just have to when she's young you're gonna be like,

00:32:14.180 --> 00:32:16.140
I mean, it's not my fault that Tim intervened.

00:32:16.140 --> 00:32:17.279
It's the recommendation.

00:32:23.359 --> 00:32:24.200
Are we in yet?

00:32:24.200 --> 00:32:25.519
Yeah, all we gotta do is dial up,

00:32:25.519 --> 00:32:28.059
use the code, and do our best impression of Jeff Johns.

00:32:28.059 --> 00:32:30.599
I mean, Metro Motors is all the way on the other side of the city.

00:32:31.379 --> 00:32:32.059
I hurried.

00:32:36.879 --> 00:32:38.940
Hello, Mr. Johns. How may I help you?

00:32:39.019 --> 00:32:40.059
Hello. Hi.

00:32:40.899 --> 00:32:43.759
I'm driving in Metropolis, and I seem to have made a wrong turn.

00:32:43.839 --> 00:32:46.579
There's no street signs, and my map screen is broken.

00:32:46.899 --> 00:32:48.039
Could you tell me where I am?

00:32:48.480 --> 00:32:50.000
No problem, sir. One moment.

00:32:51.319 --> 00:32:53.519
You're at 3rd and Grant. Have a nice day.

00:32:54.179 --> 00:32:56.159
Great. All right. Let's go. I'll drive.

00:32:58.059 --> 00:32:59.179
Clark?

00:33:28.059 --> 00:33:33.619
Why isn't it working?

00:33:33.779 --> 00:33:34.679
Tell me where she is!

00:33:35.359 --> 00:33:36.879
It's never supposed to be like this, Clark.

00:33:36.940 --> 00:33:37.539
Where is she?

00:33:37.919 --> 00:33:40.960
I never even used my powers in high school, but when I came to college,

00:33:41.200 --> 00:33:43.799
I had to win so bad. I started. I couldn't stop.

00:33:50.139 --> 00:33:51.139
Jeff, listen to me.

00:33:51.720 --> 00:33:54.700
You have to tell me where she is. You don't want to murder another person.

00:33:55.779 --> 00:33:57.899
Coop was going to tell the world that Teflon Teflon

00:33:57.899 --> 00:33:58.039
was the only thing that could kill me.

00:33:58.059 --> 00:34:00.960
He was a tailback with some kind of freak cheating his way into the record books.

00:34:01.599 --> 00:34:03.019
I couldn't let him do that.

00:34:04.679 --> 00:34:05.819
Tell me where she is.

00:34:07.500 --> 00:34:07.940
Please.

00:34:10.400 --> 00:34:11.340
She's down there.

