00:35:10.340 --> 00:35:11.400
Who would have thought it?

00:35:12.119 --> 00:35:13.960
Jeff Johns seemed like such a nice kid.

00:35:14.420 --> 00:35:14.659
Yeah.

00:35:15.079 --> 00:35:16.500
If I take this football scholarship,

00:35:16.619 --> 00:35:18.239
I'm going to be in the same situation as Jeff.

00:35:19.820 --> 00:35:22.179
I'm going to have to lie on every physical,

00:35:23.139 --> 00:35:24.019
rig every test.

00:35:25.239 --> 00:35:26.719
I'm going to have to do anything I can

00:35:26.719 --> 00:35:28.179
to protect my secret.

00:35:29.719 --> 00:35:31.219
I want to believe that I could go out there

00:35:31.219 --> 00:35:33.179
and play football like any normal college kid.

00:35:33.759 --> 00:35:34.799
But the fact is,

00:35:34.879 --> 00:35:36.359
I have powers that no other athlete has.

00:35:38.799 --> 00:35:39.639
Coop was right.

00:35:40.399 --> 00:35:42.379
It's not fair that Jeff was out there on that field,

00:35:42.859 --> 00:35:44.619
just like it's not fair when I'm out there competing.

00:35:48.819 --> 00:35:50.399
So I've decided to give up football.

00:35:53.139 --> 00:35:53.539
Clark.

00:35:56.719 --> 00:36:01.679
I know how difficult it is to give up something you love.

00:36:02.799 --> 00:36:05.500
But this decision you made, son,

00:36:05.539 --> 00:36:07.959
it shows integrity well beyond your years.

00:36:10.879 --> 00:36:12.319
Why don't I feel good about it?

00:36:22.519 --> 00:36:23.439
Look at me, Clark.

00:36:25.599 --> 00:36:26.699
If you have your heart,

00:36:26.719 --> 00:36:29.659
I'm going to set on going to Met U or any other school.

00:36:31.439 --> 00:36:32.419
Somehow, someway,

00:36:32.500 --> 00:36:34.399
your mother and I will make sure that you get to go.

00:36:36.159 --> 00:36:37.019
Is that understood?

00:36:44.659 --> 00:36:45.059
Yeah.

00:36:48.179 --> 00:36:48.579
Good.

00:36:48.579 --> 00:36:48.639
Good.

